{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211510","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1421151001:0":{"text":"이게... 드래곤의 알인가요? 깊은바위 수정과 은혜의 이슬이라는 거짓말, 그리고 드워프와 에세일의 죄악은 모두 이 알에서 시작된 거였죠...","source_cn":"这就是……龙蛋吗？营造了深岩晶与恩典灵露的谎言，矮人与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC09B47BBC41EE8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421151002:1":{"text":"오~ 좀 치는데, 꼬마 아가씨? 거대한 드래곤보다 발 밑의 알을 먼저 눈여겨 보다니.","source_cn":"不错嘛，小丫头，比起那庞然巨龙，你会更关心脚下的蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028D41FA47C150C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421151003:1":{"text":"인듀어가 여기에 처음 왔을 때도 이 알들이 부화하지 못한다는 것을 안타까워 했어.","source_cn":"当年因度厄来到这里时，也曾经悲伤过，这些蛋无法孵化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFBCF694410DBC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421151004:1":{"text":"그 참회와 연민이야말로, 진정한 영웅으로 자라날 수 있었던 원천이겠죠...","source_cn":"嗯，这份忏悔与悲悯，正是让英雄得以成长为英雄的源泉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06913BF53A96F4EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421151005:1":{"text":"동료들을 이끄는 재능, 포위망을 뚫고 나가는 날카로움... 인듀어 님을 지금처럼 성장시킨 건 계속해서 이어지는 따뜻한 감정이었어요.","source_cn":"从引领同伴的天才，到杀出重围的锐气，浇灌因度厄大人成长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x958E7D6BC1B81B7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421151006:1":{"text":"그런데요, 혹시... 전설에 나오는 그 신의 활, 어떤 모습이었는지 알려주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"对了，我能请教下，那传说中的神弓是什么样子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32CF6AA42784EAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421151007:1":{"text":"둔가엘이라면 내가 그 누구보다 잘 알지! 잘 들어보라고. 그때 말이야...","source_cn":"当然，关于杜恩加尔，我可熟得不能再熟了，我给你讲啊，当时——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFFA908C44010D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421151008:0":{"text":"조아는 들뜬 목소리로 올디비에게 둔가엘에 대한 이야기를 늘어놓았다...","source_cn":"祖娅兴致勃勃地为欧蒂薇讲述了杜恩加尔背后的故事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD373217CEDF2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧蒂薇":{"text":"올디비","source":"欧蒂薇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}